{"unit_id":"JunyuZhan__dsh-privmask#card-zh","repo":"JunyuZhan/dsh-privmask","commit":"18fd042fbde2d0078851b7b418d6cca743192e37","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-privmask 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的本地脱敏插件，接入模型请求、会话步骤和工具结果处理流程。它在请求发送前遮罩凭据、联系方式及中文实体，并在本地日志写入前处理用户消息和工具结果；模型流中的占位符可在本地还原。插件还提供可调整的脱敏类别、非文本内容策略和一个隐私设置卡片。适合希望在 DSH 使用云端模型前处理敏感文本的用户。默认无需 API 密钥；可选本地 OCR 需要已有的 ~/.ocr-tool 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:590-655","lib/index.js:52-110","client-src/PrivmaskCard.tsx:1-14"]}
{"unit_id":"JunyuZhan__dsh-privmask#card-en","repo":"JunyuZhan/dsh-privmask","commit":"18fd042fbde2d0078851b7b418d6cca743192e37","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-privmask is a DSH web plugin that masks credentials and personal details in model requests and session logs. It restores known placeholders locally and offers configurable redaction settings in a privacy card. Optional local OCR needs an existing ~/.ocr-tool setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:590-655","lib/index.js:52-110","client-src/PrivmaskCard.tsx:1-14"]}
